Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.89,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.91,0:01:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is the only one who\Ncan restore Grandpa's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've been there before\Nwith Tristan and Bacora.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.45,0:01:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I vaguely recall a secret room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus' sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was just a dream, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.91,0:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if we were both dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to remember it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus fought with Bakura, and\Nthen Bakura's evil spirit came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did we forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet he cast a spell on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.05,0:01:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I've struggled to\Nobtain is now beyond my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeping their souls will not serve me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of the defeat\NI suffered at the hands of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and the mysterious spirit\Nof his Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am duty-bound to fulfill my pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I release these three souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia, I'm sorry, but I have failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My attempt to take over Kyber Corp,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,my efforts to get all the Millennium\NItems was all done for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,in the hopes that I could\Nrestore you, body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Akurov.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you're the one that\Npossesses the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I intend to have all the items.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to wager yours on a shadow game?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a second\Nchance at a Millennium item.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What you couldn't win from Yugi,\Nperhaps you can win from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you defeat me and claim my ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,your deepest desires might not\Nbe beyond your grasp after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Millennium Item allows you to\Nlook into people's minds, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine allows me to see into their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have but to look at your deck, Pegasus,\Nand it reveals to me your true nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Happy Lover card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows you have\Nexperienced the joys of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this card is upside down, which\Nmeans your romance ended in tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the next card should show me\Nmore about your present than your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the Mask of Darkness, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So your recent actions were all just\Nan effort to mask your true objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Objectives that came from\Ndeep within your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.55,0:03:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought you even had a heart,\Nlet alone one so easily broken? Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, there is one\Nmore card to be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see your future?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Doma, the Angel of Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an appropriate card for your future,\Nsince I will now silence you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, mortal, for a shadow game\Nthe likes of which you've never played.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This match will be played on\Nthe landscape of our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Really now, Pegasus, is\Nthat all you can muster, ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've been fatigued\Nby your shadow duel with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,yugi your mind is weary\Nwhile mine is fresh you are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,defeated a rank amateur\Nto one whom has played for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,centuries you've lived\Nfor centuries what kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,creature are you i am the\None who will possess all the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,millennium items and i shall\Nuse their combined might
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to conquer the entire world\NYou have lost the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and that entitles me to take your Millennium\NItem the way you meant to take Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It came from the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounded like Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Croquet, what happened to Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.49,0:05:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's suddenly taken ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Grandpa and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.37,0:05:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised he'd free their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you get a look at Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who or what could have done that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should check out\Nthe towers, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is where Pegasus hangs out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.79,0:05:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever that woman is, she sure is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be a diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll find something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about Pegasus. Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's written about that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:05:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems to be very important to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling Cecilia, at last I've finally\Nfound a way to restore you to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an elaborate plan, but\Nnot one beyond my genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It involves the Kaiba Corporation\Nand some ancient magic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I plan to harness when I\Nobtain more Millennium items.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This might explain why he set up the\Ntournament and why he went after Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe who this girl is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious he's hung up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my lovely darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Cecilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how I've loved you since the\Nfirst moment we met those many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was at a party at my\Nfather's country estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a gala event with celebrities\Nand tycoons from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who was anyone was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But by far, the one that\Nimpressed me most was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we were only\Nchildren, I knew I was in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.55,0:07:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We were drawn to each other, and from\Nthat moment on, we were inseparable,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You inflamed my passions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,inspired me to become a painter,\Nand you were my favorite subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so in love, and just when I\Nthought things couldn't get any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you agreed to take my hand once\Nagain, this time in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the happiest day of\Nmy life, but it was cut short,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,for it seemed just as we said our vows,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you were struck down by a devastating\Ndisease, and taken from me and this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as if a blow had\Nstruck me from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was filled with sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From that moment on, I\Ncould no longer paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart grew bitter and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to accept the idea that our\Nlife together was forever lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to scour the\Nearth in an attempt to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,find any way to reach you\Nbeyond this mortal veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My journey eventually brought me\Nto the great pyramids of Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that mysterious land\Nwhose These ancient people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,believed in a life\Nbeyond the here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,a belief I wanted to embrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I had just begun to explore that\Nancient city when fate intervened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stranger, heed my advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You have journeyed far, seeking\Nto cure the ache within your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take great care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The search to heal the pains of a broken\Nheart might lead to only greater heartache.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how do you know? It matters\Nnot. Go home. But I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized if he somehow knew of my\Npain, maybe he could help me heal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed him against his wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Although the passage seemed to lead to\Nthe bowels of the earth, still I followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And my footsteps led me to a hidden crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but apparently buried beneath\Ncenturies of civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you chose not to heed my warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a guardian of the Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this sacred place has been discovered,\Nthe only way to leave is to be chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could these Millennium\NItems be part of my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You will now be tested by the\Nitem itself, the Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eye itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Each Millennium Item awaits the day its\Nfated possessor appears to claim it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.47,0:09:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and punishes those who are undeserving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Punishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,if you pass its test, it will empower you\Nto see more than you've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I fail its test?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are not the one\Ndestined to possess it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,all that awaits you is nightmares\Nbeyond your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You have not descended\Ninto chaos and madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your eyes will be opened to\Ndimensions beyond the here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,like having a sixth sense, capable of\Nseeing worlds and times outside our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian, it's really you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia, I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My darling, we're reunited at long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.09,0:10:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But be warned, seeing's not the\Nsame as touching, holding, being...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That is beyond the power\Nof this Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have once again\Nbeen engulfed by despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But seeing you for that brief moment gave\Nme more hope than I thought possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you were gone from my world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there was still a\Nway to reach your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't rest till I\Nfound a way to bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,touch the flower that is your face\Nand gaze into your eyes once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes on to say that later,\NPegasus got an inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He found a way to combine\NKaiba's virtual technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,with the magic of Millennium\Nitems to restore Cecilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothing about Grandpa or\Nthe Kaiba brothers. Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Three soul cards, and they're all blank!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus must have freed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they're okay.\NCome on, Yugi. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.35,0:11:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a Millennium Item, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The disturbance in the mystic\Nalignment brings me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:12:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not who has stolen Pegasus'\NMillennium Eye and upset the cosmic balance,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but perhaps I should begin my search here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,those who have come to\Npossess one Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Item have often been\Ndriven to covet them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense that the thief hides\Nsomewhere within the castle walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall begin my\Ninvestigation with this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Key will unlock his\Nmind and reveal the truth to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This youth's mind contains two chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,One is a room of a pure\Ninnocence, devoid of malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The purity of soul I sense\Nhere could not possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,belong to the criminal that\Nstole the Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In the other chamber, I\Ndetect another presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and this soul is much more mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You may enter my chamber\Nif that is what you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.07,0:13:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I warn you, tread cautiously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I will allow no harm to come to\Nthe boy whose vessel I share.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your presence here intrigues me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, I've ventured\Ninto the minds of many people,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've never encountered a\Nchamber so dank and mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel as though I'm in a tomb\Nof an ancient Egyptian pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you entered my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself before\Nyou trespass further.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand an explanation\Nfor your intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I seek a criminal who has stolen\Nthe power of a Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been five long millennia since\Nthose ancient items were created.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Their magical energies were\Ntrapped in them by a brave pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Combined, these seven Millennium Items\Npossess power enough to conquer the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence, many evil men have ventured\Nto gather these items for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my heritage to guard\Nthe Millennium Items,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:14:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and my charge to punish the thief\Nwho stole Pegasus' Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And you accuse me of being that criminal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.33,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have already taken refuge\Nin the vessel of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That does not bode well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you are not the criminal, then\Nyou have nothing to fear from my search.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty until proven innocent, an\Nancient concept for this modern age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I have nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then grant me passage to\Nyour unconscious mind. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open the doors for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You may search them to\Nyour heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen such\Ncomplexity as in this one's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, he is an extraordinary individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I will leave\Nyou to your exploration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There are mysteries within mysteries here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Levels beyond levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So I must probe each\Nchamber for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a trap despite his cooperation.\NSomething in his mind conspires.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep me from the truth so\Nmany doors so many false entries
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,all designed to distract me from\Nthe proper path but no matter how
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,they try to confuse and disorient\Nme my millennium key will show me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the true way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It draws me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth lies within.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears safe enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall proceed with extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Another trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have I seen mental defenses so
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be the end of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fall into this deep darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be trapped eternally\Nwithin this cryptic mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why the spirit of\Nmy puzzle's doing this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't let him hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the innocent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I seek only the truth, but it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My way is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think the spirit of the\Npuzzle is doing this on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling that there are\Nsome memories hidden even from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.59,0:16:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure wish I knew what they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The door, it opens for you, as if seeking\Nto answer your curiosity. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it yield to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these stone tablets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.25,0:16:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 years ago, Egyptian kings played\Na game of great and terrible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,These shadow games were played\Nwith real magic and real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But those games erupted into a war that\Nthreatened to destroy the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Until a brave pharaoh locked the magic\Naway, sealing the monsters in stone tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:17:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But how could your other personality\Nhave knowledge of this ancient history?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do I suddenly sense\Nhere, in his unconscious mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,magic that the world has not\Nknown for five millennia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They look just like the monsters on\Nthe cards we use to play with today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.31,0:17:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A new threat appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.09,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He prepares to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's another mental defense\Nagainst any intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magician intends to\Ndestroy us both. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we can stop him, we\Nwill never leave this chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This surface on which I stand may\Nbe the means of our salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If that other image spawned the\Nessence of the Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,then this one must contain the\Nmagical energy of his nemesis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the Blue Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can use the power of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the Millennium Key to unleash its\Nmight, it will obliterate the Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:17:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he'd never hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, we are not intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand aside and let us leave in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We will not reveal the\Nhidden secrets. You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,who in ancient times obeyed only the\Npharaoh, gives heed to this youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible, unless this\Nboy is the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The prophecy comes to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for my rude\Nintrusion into your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not realize that you are\Nthe Chosen One and that the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient predictions have\Nfinally been fulfilled at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,In my search for a thief, I\Ninstead found the most worthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,one fated to unlock all the magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The theft of Pegasus'\NMillennium Eye was but the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,first sign that evil once\Nagain walks the Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:18:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing madness in its wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.75,0:19:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As in ancient times, Chaos once more\Nthreatens to envelop an unsuspecting world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And only he who solved the\NMillennium Puzzle can save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else you\Ncan tell me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take great care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For whoever the thief is who\Nstole Pegasus' Millennium Item,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,he will also come seeking yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's almost too\Nscary to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But if a guy like you couldn't\Nfind him, how do you expect me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.43,0:19:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a lot more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Shadi, and I am certain\Nthat we will meet again another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But until then, stay true to your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, the fate of the\Nworld rests on your shoulders.
